+## Changed
+
+Added the storage readers and their typed values:
+
+- `read_task_sizes`, `TaskSize` and `ScopeResolver` under `src/read/task_history/sizes.rs`, exported from the crate root.
+- `read_dependencies_added` and `DependencyPair` under `src/read/task_history/dependencies.rs`, exported from the crate root.
+- `read_change_fixes` under `src/read/fixes.rs`, exported from the crate root.
+- `read_result_disclosures` in `src/read/results.rs`, calling the existing private disclosure reader so `snapshot.rs` is unchanged.
+
+Extended the task-stream `Event` with its timestamp and a raw data-member accessor, and added a local leading-number comparator for task and event file names. Added `tests/reading_task_sizes.rs`, `tests/reading_dependencies_added.rs` and `tests/reading_change_records.rs` proving every scenario row, plus focused first-attempt edge cases that kill the surviving observers' mutants.
+
+`cargo fmt --all`, the task verify and `OSQ_CHANGE=openspec/changes/330-rust-report-history-sizes sh scripts/verify-rust.sh` pass. Targeted cargo-mutants runs over the new touched readers report no missed mutants.
+
